    "introduction": "Replacing the lightbulb involves opening up the machine. You will need to purchase a sewing machine bulb set, including the wire plug-in, to replace it.",
    "what_you_need": {
        "parts": [
            {
                "text": "Zip Ties",
                "url": "https://www.ifixit.com/products/zip-ties",
                "image": "https://cart-products.cdn.ifixit.com/cart-products/1grs1kZYK4AxAgU1.thumbnail",
                "price": "$3.99 New / 4 inch / 100 pcs / Black$3.19 New / 4 inch / 100 pcs / White$5.99 New / 8 inch / 100 pcs / Black$7.99 New / 4 / 6 / 8 inch / 650 pcs / Assorted Colors"
            }
        ],
        "tools": [
            {
                "text": "Phillips #2 Screwdriver",
                "url": "https://www.ifixit.com/products/6-in-1-screwdriver",
                "image": "https://cart-products.cdn.ifixit.com/cart-products/LYcK13TjejldWD5Y.thumbnail",
                "price": "$6.99"
            },
            {
                "text": "Scissors",
                "url": "https://www.ifixit.com/products/utility-scissors",
                "image": "https://cart-products.cdn.ifixit.com/cart-products/YZFc6xfCFTuHFhsP.thumbnail",
                "price": "$5.59"
            },
            {
                "text": "6‑in-1 Screwdriver",
                "url": "https://www.ifixit.com/products/6-in-1-screwdriver",
                "image": "https://cart-products.cdn.ifixit.com/cart-products/LYcK13TjejldWD5Y.thumbnail",
                "price": "$6.99"
            }
        ]
    },
    "steps": [
        {
            "step_number": 1,
            "title": "Back Panel",
            "text": "Place the machine on a solid surface.\nRemove the 14mm Phillips #2 screw holding on the face cover.",
            "image": "https://guide-images.cdn.ifixit.com/igi/xUpvdVUuBtCAINGw.medium",
            "image_links": [],
            "edit_link": "https://www.ifixit.com/Guide/edit/22759/59538",
            "comment_links": []
        },
        {
            "step_number": 2,
            "title": "",
            "text": "Remove the two 14mm Phillips #2 screws and two 22mm Phillips #2 screws that secure the rear casing.",
            "image": "https://guide-images.cdn.ifixit.com/igi/htxYfpdJaFOwTnAd.medium",
            "image_links": [],
            "edit_link": "https://www.ifixit.com/Guide/edit/22759/59516",
            "comment_links": []
        },
        {
            "step_number": 3,
            "title": "",
            "text": "Lay the machine on its side.\nRemove the four 10mm Phillips #2 screws that hold the bottom panel in place.\nThe feet will come off with the screws.",
            "image_links": [],
            "edit_link": "https://www.ifixit.com/Guide/edit/22759/59520",
            "comment_links": []
        },
        {
            "step_number": 4,
            "title": "",
            "text": "Remove the bottom panel.",
            "image_links": [],
            "edit_link": "https://www.ifixit.com/Guide/edit/22759/59537",
            "comment_links": []
        },
        {
            "step_number": 5,
            "title": "",
            "text": "Place the machine upright.\nRemove the rear casing.\nYou may have to wiggle the panel and pull at the same time.",
            "image_links": [],
            "edit_link": "https://www.ifixit.com/Guide/edit/22759/59521",
            "comment_links": []
        },
        {
            "step_number": 6,
            "title": "Lightbulb",
            "text": "Using scissors, clip the two zip ties securing the lightbulb wire.",
            "image_links": [],
            "edit_link": "https://www.ifixit.com/Guide/edit/22759/59585",
            "comment_links": []
        },
        {
            "step_number": 7,
            "title": "",
            "text": "Place the machine on its side, with access to the bottom.\nGently pull out the white wire connecting the bulb to the machine.",
            "image_links": [],
            "edit_link": "https://www.ifixit.com/Guide/edit/22759/59589",
            "comment_links": []
        },
        {
            "step_number": 8,
            "title": "",
            "text": "Move the wire out from under the plastic hook.",
            "image_links": [],
            "edit_link": "https://www.ifixit.com/Guide/edit/22759/59590",
            "comment_links": []
        },
        {
            "step_number": 9,
            "title": "",
            "text": "Place the machine upright.\nUsing the flathead screwdriver, remove the 5mm Flathead screw holding on the lightbulb bracket.",
            "image_links": [],
            "edit_link": "https://www.ifixit.com/Guide/edit/22759/59586",
            "comment_links": []
        },
        {
            "step_number": 10,
            "title": "",
            "text": "Remove the lightbulb assembly.",
            "image_links": [],
            "edit_link": "https://www.ifixit.com/Guide/edit/22759/59587",
            "comment_links": []
        }
    ],
    "conclusion": {
        "text": "To reassemble your device, follow these instructions in reverse order.",
